
@prod=https://veilspan.com/
@local=http://127.0.0.1:8010
@host={{local}}

### Local-only. Production must not use admin:admin (rejected as insecure).
GET {{host}}/admin/export
Authorization: Basic {{ADMIN_USER}}:{{ADMIN_PASSWORD}}

###
POST {{host}}/admin/import  HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Basic {{ADMIN_USER}}:{{ADMIN_PASSWORD}}

< export-new.json
